      "why": "Ruling (owner to confirm): L510-517 load the desktop workbench with `await import(workbenchUrl)`, where workbenchUrl is computed at run time (new URL(`vs/workbench/workbench.desktop.main.js`, baseUrl).href into out/, or '../../../workbench/workbench.desktop.main.js' in dev). The import() has no literal specifier that names a file, so by the eval's definition (a statement whose specifier resolves to the file) it isn't counted; VS Code's own import lint (.eslint-plugin-local/utils.ts, createImportRuleListener) also checks only string-literal specifiers. Counting computed imports would add this file, src/vs/sessions/electron-browser/sessions.ts and build/vite/workbench-electron.ts (CL4 would be 66)."
    },
